{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Atmospheric FPS-horror hybrid where human ambition meets primal terror.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/c683847c7b6e8d7e31427a5be9707343.poster.avif?t=1759142355\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/c683847c7b6e8d7e31427a5be9707343.webm?t=1759142355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/c683847c7b6e8d7e31427a5be9707343.mp4?t=1759142355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person shooter with survival horror elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientific horror atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly graphics aesthetics reminiscent of late 90's games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding on the story established in '<i>Snowsquall Grip</i>', '<i>Re.Surs</i>', and '<i>Plastomorphosis</i>'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u200e\u200e  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/d3e3dc285dd242681d9c75499f730d20.poster.avif?t=1759142355\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/d3e3dc285dd242681d9c75499f730d20.webm?t=1759142355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/d3e3dc285dd242681d9c75499f730d20.mp4?t=1759142355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heart of Modern-City, the Continent's sprawling capital, an ominous discovery was made <strong>\u2013</strong> dark energy particles accumulating at an unprecedented rate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Supreme One's Government immediately began construction of a classified laboratory complex within the imposing Nexus Tower. This colossal structure\u00a0dominates the skyline, serving as both a governmental headquarters and a research facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientists studying the mysterious concentration proposed the &quot;Synthesis&quot; experiment <strong>\u2013</strong> an ambitious attempt to isolate and manipulate a single dark particle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success would unlock the secrets of the Re.Surs, the unique dark energy that has permeated the entire Continent since the events documented in the &quot;Snowsquall Grip&quot; classified event.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now this catastrophic failure threatens the future of not only Modern-City, but all life on the Continent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the assistant researcher arriving late to your shift, you alone must contain the corruption that scientists couldn't control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/acbcfb0e47589ee26abfee2895249024.poster.avif?t=1759142355\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/acbcfb0e47589ee26abfee2895249024.webm?t=1759142355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/acbcfb0e47589ee26abfee2895249024.mp4?t=1759142355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629200?t=1759142355","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/54a8511036a86cd2497a5794f626989e19691571/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759142355","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/3541f9e1204b6e4634f5b216c44527ba6ef850ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759142355","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/3541f9e1204b6e4634f5b216c44527ba6ef850ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759142355","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains different horror themes, blood, gore (such as corpses), depictions of death, and violence."},"demos":[{"appid":3661800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Atmospheric FPS-horror hybrid where human ambition meets primal terror.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/c683847c7b6e8d7e31427a5be9707343.poster.avif?t=1759142355\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/c683847c7b6e8d7e31427a5be9707343.webm?t=1759142355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sourc